{"id":"u-ad952791-5a0d-41e2-99ae-ca77bd7f7325","src":"community","title":"Strength & Performance","author":"Tim Guzman","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/OFv4Lx-hybrid-strength-and-performance-1","desc":"Hybrid Strength & Performance is an 8-week program for lifters who want to build serious barbell strength while maintaining athletic conditioning, upper-body muscle, grip, and relative strength.\n\nThe week is built around focused sessions that pair a primary strength or hypertrophy movement with running and athletic work. Bench press, squat, Romanian deadlift, weighted pull-ups, dips, and handstand push-ups develop pressing, pulling, lower-body strength, and shoulder stability without requiring marathon gym sessions.\n\nProgression comes from consistent quality work: heavy compound sets build force production, while moderate- and higher-rep accessories add muscle and reinforce positions. Running volume increases gradually across the program to improve work capacity without overwhelming recovery.\n\nTrain with clean reps, stop most work near the prescribed effort, and prioritize recovery. The goal is straightforward: get stronger, look more athletic, move well, and finish each week with enough in reserve to keep progressing.","level":["Novice","Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-26T02:06:54.737Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Tuesday","Friday"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":80,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":65,"x":4},{"r":8,"pct":90}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":16,"rpe":8,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"max":1,"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":90,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[